'''Rocks''' can be found within [[scavenger beast|scavenger]] rooms during the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. Players can mine the rocks, with the use of a [[pickaxe]], to create a shortcut through the room by creating climbable rubble. Players who mine the rocks will receive points for the raid. The [[Mining]] level required to mine the rocks will vary based on the Mining levels of the players participating in the raid.

